# Pairs with CausalOrder. Opens the gate before every active silo advertises the floor capability, so a
# silo running the old build appends below the floor.
MODULE: CausalOrderGateOpensBeforeEverySiloCapable
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the capability gate opens while a silo cannot refuse a late stamp
PERTURBS: EnableFloor

--- FIND
    /\ \A p \in Parts : capable[p]
    /\ ~floorOn
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the gate does not wait for every silo.
    /\ ~floorOn
--- END
